WEBVTT

00:00:01.770 --> 00:00:04.940
Sigh...huh?

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:07.820
What? Roka and the others aren't here?

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:10.110
Yeah, it's unusual right...

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:13.410
Oh right. It's the first time that the two of us have been alone.

00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:15.790
Kazama-senpai, let's play a game.

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:18.000
No thanks, I want to go home.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.630
What...let's play, let's play!

00:00:20.630 --> 00:00:22.630
Don't bother me! Play by yourself.

00:00:22.630 --> 00:00:27.340
Okay. If I lose, I'll tell you our senpais' secrets.

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:29.760
Huh, it's not like I want to know.

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:33.220
But, if I know their weaknesses...

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:36.600
It might help me in the future.

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:39.230
Alright! I'll take you up on your offer.

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:43.770
Let's play a fighting game!

00:00:44.070 --> 00:00:47.570
My specialty is fighting games. I got you.

00:00:48.530 --> 00:00:49.530
But wait.

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:53.410
If she's intentionally challenging me, is she confident in winning?

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:58.200
She's weak.

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:06.500
Chitose-senpai's naked body is amazing.

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:07.760
Huh!? What!?

00:01:11.340 --> 00:01:14.220
Come on, there's still a lot of water left.

00:01:14.220 --> 00:01:15.810
Let's do it.

00:01:15.810 --> 00:01:18.060
That's fine, I'm about to go home.

00:01:18.350 --> 00:01:20.850
Hey! Aniki, what are you doing?

00:01:21.690 --> 00:01:22.850
Huh! Imouto.

00:01:22.900 --> 00:01:25.610
Great timing! Switch with me.

00:01:25.610 --> 00:01:27.530
Huh! What?

00:01:29.650 --> 00:01:31.450
She's really weak.

00:01:35.740 --> 00:01:39.910
Right. Roka-senpai's body is also great.

00:01:41.330 --> 00:01:43.210
That's a lie!

00:01:43.460 --> 00:01:45.840
Alright, next round I'll be serious.

00:01:45.840 --> 00:01:47.960
Aniki, did you see your mail?

00:01:47.960 --> 00:01:50.170
Mom asked you to buy groceries.

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:54.050
Come on, let's go!

00:01:54.050 --> 00:01:56.050
Hey, don't pull me!

00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:09.780
Kazama-senpai, can you lend me a hand?

00:02:14.070 --> 00:02:15.450
Of course. Imouto too..

00:02:15.490 --> 00:02:18.870
Huh! Me...?

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:56.800
Welcome! We meet again on this big day.

00:03:56.840 --> 00:04:02.930
It's good to drink a glass of water early in the morning, right?

00:04:03.140 --> 00:04:05.810
Does everyone want this water?

00:04:06.230 --> 00:04:08.440
Water!

00:04:09.190 --> 00:04:11.520
What the hell is this?!

00:04:12.730 --> 00:04:14.940
It's happening this year too.

00:04:15.070 --> 00:04:17.240
What competition is this?

00:04:17.240 --> 00:04:20.030
It's a Spring Water Race competition.

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:20.740
Spring water?

00:04:20.740 --> 00:04:24.870
This shrine has famous spring water.

00:04:24.870 --> 00:04:29.370
As it's told, each year special water from this spring will come out.

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:30.500
That is what was told.

00:04:30.630 --> 00:04:32.210
It's obviously a lie!

00:04:32.210 --> 00:04:37.380
Since the special water is a limited resource, they organized this Spring Race Competition.

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:46.100
To memorialize this special day, how about this special Shrine Hat, for just 4000 yen!

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:50.650
That won't do!

00:04:51.690 --> 00:04:55.860
To win, we must work together.

00:04:55.860 --> 00:05:01.240
You should be able to win by yourself. The other contestants are just old folks.

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:06.080
But last year I was forced to retire halfway.

00:05:06.080 --> 00:05:09.660
Even a smart girl like you...

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:13.750
Yes, there was a strong contestant.

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:17.590
She was pretty and had a big rack.

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:22.010
Is that her?

00:05:22.010 --> 00:05:24.010
I think so.

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:26.930
Where have I seen her before...?

00:05:27.140 --> 00:05:31.230
To think that I would meet that kid again in a place like this...

00:05:32.140 --> 00:05:35.820
That shopping mall fire incident.

00:05:35.820 --> 00:05:40.610
Enough! Let's go!

00:05:40.610 --> 00:05:42.030
Sorry, sorry.

00:05:42.030 --> 00:05:43.570
That too!

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:46.990
Did you get hugged by her in the clubroom too!?

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:48.330
Hell no!

00:05:48.330 --> 00:05:54.710
I understand. I'll win this spring water race and become Kazama-senpai's imouto!

00:05:54.710 --> 00:05:56.090
So it's okay.

00:05:56.090 --> 00:05:59.340
What's with that unrelated decision?! What are you, a king or what?!

00:05:59.340 --> 00:06:01.550
No, I'm an imouto!

00:06:01.550 --> 00:06:02.760
No way!

00:06:02.760 --> 00:06:05.800
Why are we fighting amongst ourselves? Do you really want to win?

00:06:05.890 --> 00:06:09.520
You're gonna enter too, senpai?

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:12.020
It can't be helped since we already came here.

00:06:12.020 --> 00:06:14.020
Huh!?

00:06:15.350 --> 00:06:19.570
Alright, but you gotta buy me ice cream on the way home.

00:06:19.570 --> 00:06:21.320
Leave it to me, imouto!

00:06:21.320 --> 00:06:22.190
Don't call me that!

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:23.570
I'll buy you anything.

00:06:23.570 --> 00:06:25.570
I am not talking to you.

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:31.620
So...the one that I should watch out for is that woman.

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:33.040
I don't think so.

00:06:33.040 --> 00:06:35.040
Huh! Why are you here?

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:38.420
Why? Of course for the water.

00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:42.010
Once in a while, my vegetables in the garden need good quality water too.

00:06:42.170 --> 00:06:46.050
Wait a second, if you're here, then that means she's here too.

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:47.970
No, it's impossible.

00:06:47.970 --> 00:06:49.720
Yea, I'm here.

00:06:50.100 --> 00:06:54.770
I want delicious barley tea water.

00:06:54.770 --> 00:06:55.730
Barley tea!

00:06:55.730 --> 00:06:58.020
Those guys...

00:06:58.150 --> 00:07:02.940
Their intentions are to just water soil and make tea...

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:06.990
What's wrong with just drinking the water?

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:08.620
Don't tell me you're looking for more foes?

00:07:14.210 --> 00:07:18.460
Get ready everyone! The rules are simple.

00:07:18.460 --> 00:07:23.210
Hurry up to the goal and obtain the water.

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:26.930
On your mark! Start!

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:29.100
Let's go!

00:07:29.100 --> 00:07:31.100
Wait a sec, aniki!

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:36.230
My sandal slipped...haha.

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:43.280
Hey...we've been left behind.

00:07:43.280 --> 00:07:48.780
That's okay. It's not like I wanted to enter or win.

00:07:48.780 --> 00:07:50.200
Let's win!

00:07:50.200 --> 00:07:51.240
No way.

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:54.200
We're already here, so let's win.

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:57.290
Don't worry, onii-chan. We'll win somehow.

00:07:57.290 --> 00:07:59.290
I don't recall becoming your aniki!

00:07:59.290 --> 00:08:03.710
Oni...onii-chan...

00:08:05.670 --> 00:08:07.300
What is it!

00:08:07.300 --> 00:08:10.300
You don't need to force yourself.

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:11.430
I'm not!

00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:15.470
Alright, let's go!

00:08:28.950 --> 00:08:29.860
What's going on here?

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:31.490
You finally came.

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:34.620
Huh? You're still here? What happened up ahead?

00:08:34.620 --> 00:08:39.040
Those two are having a duel right there.

00:08:39.040 --> 00:08:42.130
The other contestant is up there too.

00:08:45.590 --> 00:08:49.590
That woman is amazing. Is Prez gonna lose?

00:08:49.590 --> 00:08:55.260
It's our chance. Let's ignore them and go on ahead quietly.

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:56.810
Right...

00:09:01.150 --> 00:09:02.980
This duel is mine!

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:06.230
Yea, it's time to run!

00:09:06.230 --> 00:09:08.030
Huh! That's fast!

00:09:08.030 --> 00:09:12.700
In that case, I have to stop that woman for real!

00:09:12.870 --> 00:09:13.990
For real?!

00:09:14.070 --> 00:09:18.040
Secret technique! Hat Cutter!

00:09:18.040 --> 00:09:19.460
That's whats you meant!

00:09:19.460 --> 00:09:22.210
Alright! Secret technique, Hat Cutter!

00:09:22.210 --> 00:09:24.380
You too! That's cheap!

00:09:24.380 --> 00:09:27.420
Heh! Hat Cutter!

00:09:27.630 --> 00:09:28.880
You too!?

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:31.510
To think she used the same attack as us.

00:09:31.680 --> 00:09:34.760
But one hat can't beat our combination attack!

00:09:34.760 --> 00:09:35.850
What kind of logic is that!?

00:09:35.850 --> 00:09:42.140
Just to let you know, I won this hat last year and it's not just any normal hat.

00:09:42.350 --> 00:09:46.980
Huh? Ours is just a 4000 yen hat...

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:49.070
It's losing!

00:09:51.990 --> 00:09:56.030
But that woman is more scary...

00:09:56.030 --> 00:09:57.330
What's with that facade?

00:09:57.370 --> 00:09:59.330
I'll go first. See ya!

00:09:59.330 --> 00:10:01.160
Who the hell are you?!

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:04.290
Today's fight is intense, aniki.

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:06.290
Really...?

00:10:06.380 --> 00:10:08.380
Senpai is always like this.

00:10:08.380 --> 00:10:09.590
Like this...

00:10:09.590 --> 00:10:11.800
He never acts that way at home.

00:10:11.800 --> 00:10:13.930
If I do this routinely, I really might die.

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:17.510
You joined this weird club huh...

00:10:17.640 --> 00:10:21.230
Imouto always thinks her onii-chan is right...

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:22.850
It's not like that!

00:10:23.190 --> 00:10:27.360
If you're that concerned, you should join our club and observe too.

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:31.190
We're in the same grade, so it should be more fun.

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:32.440
Then, I'll pass.

00:10:32.440 --> 00:10:35.320
Huh...you should join.

00:10:35.320 --> 00:10:35.950
Get off of me.

00:10:36.160 --> 00:10:39.990
Are those two on bad terms, onii-chan?

00:10:40.040 --> 00:10:43.910
It seems Noe doesn't really like her.

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:46.170
Don't call me that too!

00:10:46.420 --> 00:10:50.050
Huh? Why did that woman stop?

00:10:53.590 --> 00:10:55.510
What?!

00:10:55.510 --> 00:10:58.390
We can't cross that.

00:10:58.390 --> 00:11:01.850
If we can't cross that...

00:11:01.850 --> 00:11:04.560
We'll just have to jump over this cliff.

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:06.520
That's too much.

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:08.520
It's impossible.

00:11:08.940 --> 00:11:12.030
In that case, we have only one choice.

00:11:12.030 --> 00:11:13.360
That huh...

00:11:13.360 --> 00:11:16.450
What? You guys have too many tricks.

00:11:16.450 --> 00:11:20.370
We have to use the Special Technique - Love Jump.

00:11:20.370 --> 00:11:23.330
Special Technique - Love Jump is

00:11:23.330 --> 00:11:26.960
when two lovers hold hands and start jumping.

00:11:26.960 --> 00:11:30.750
At that time, the panorama around will be filled with flowers. That is the secret technique.

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:34.590
Along with it, the time and air will slow down noticeably.

00:11:34.590 --> 00:11:36.970
Give me your hand, Kazama-san!

00:11:36.970 --> 00:11:40.180
Secret Technique, Love Jump!

00:11:44.060 --> 00:11:45.350
Do you want to kill me!?

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:47.350
You're the one who wants to kill yourself!

00:11:51.940 --> 00:11:54.690
Hey, aniki. Let's just quit.

00:11:54.690 --> 00:11:57.240
It's just for a few drops of water.

00:11:57.280 --> 00:11:59.240
That's enough, right?

00:11:59.410 --> 00:12:01.410
It's not okay.

00:12:01.410 --> 00:12:05.620
Don't be selfish and involve us.

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:08.500
Right...sorry.

00:12:08.500 --> 00:12:09.250
Of course!

00:12:09.250 --> 00:12:12.380
But imouto,

00:12:12.840 --> 00:12:16.590
you said that you're gonna do it until the end right?

00:12:17.220 --> 00:12:19.430
It's okay if you wanna go home.

00:12:19.510 --> 00:12:21.970
In that case, let's go home, Aniki.

00:12:21.970 --> 00:12:23.720
No, I'm gonna continue.

00:12:23.720 --> 00:12:25.430
Huh, why?

00:12:25.470 --> 00:12:29.690
I can't quit now, I wanna win.

00:12:29.940 --> 00:12:31.480
The one who's gonna win is me!

00:12:31.480 --> 00:12:32.520
It's me!

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:37.150
You're that kinda person huh, aniki?

00:12:38.200 --> 00:12:40.860
Too bad right?

00:12:40.860 --> 00:12:42.870
Grrr...

00:12:45.620 --> 00:12:52.420
Don't think it's gonna be like you intended.

00:12:56.590 --> 00:12:57.840
Huh!?

00:12:59.680 --> 00:13:02.050
You're not jumping!

00:13:09.560 --> 00:13:15.190
That's it. I'm gonna win and get the prize!

00:13:15.190 --> 00:13:20.360
And I will know if this water tastes good or not when I make it into shaved ice!

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:24.870
So that's the Kazama family trademark.

00:13:25.410 --> 00:13:29.660
Noe-chi, you're so funny.

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:36.630
But...you're 10 years too early!

00:13:36.630 --> 00:13:38.380
They all jumped!

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:52.440
They all jumped!

00:13:52.440 --> 00:13:54.480
That's so high!

00:13:57.230 --> 00:14:00.240
That was careless of me! I didn't jump far enough!

00:14:00.240 --> 00:14:01.610
Onii!

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:11.330
Are you okay?

00:14:11.540 --> 00:14:13.710
Yes, I'm fine.

00:14:13.710 --> 00:14:15.670
Are you stupid!?

00:14:15.830 --> 00:14:21.880
It's okay. There's a river below. It's okay for me since my element is water.

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:24.930
Do you know what you're talking about? It's clear that you're an idiot.

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:28.640
This rope wasn't here before, right?

00:14:28.720 --> 00:14:30.890
Looks like she managed to escape from death.

00:14:31.020 --> 00:14:32.480
That voice?!

00:14:32.480 --> 00:14:33.690
Good, you're safe.

00:14:33.690 --> 00:14:36.110
Shawn Conecone-sensei!

00:14:37.310 --> 00:14:39.190
Thank you very much!

00:14:39.360 --> 00:14:43.450
I have work to do. See you later.

00:14:45.530 --> 00:14:50.490
Everyone, do your best for now.

00:14:50.540 --> 00:14:54.160
I'm so glad...

00:14:57.790 --> 00:15:00.840
Are...Are you an idiot!!!

00:15:00.840 --> 00:15:01.420
You're slow!

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:05.010
Why are you doing dangerous stunts like that! Like saving my aniki!

00:15:05.010 --> 00:15:11.010
What if you guys fell?! It would have made me look like an idiot!

00:15:11.010 --> 00:15:13.640
Forget it! Let's start the race up again!

00:15:13.930 --> 00:15:16.650
You're the one who's fired up.

00:15:18.270 --> 00:15:21.020
What's wrong? Let's get back in the race.

00:15:21.280 --> 00:15:25.650
I sprained my ankle.

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:27.320
Are you alright?

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:28.280
No good...

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:32.870
Sorry, it's all my fault.

00:15:32.870 --> 00:15:35.410
That's okay. You'll return the favor some day.

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:38.920
You're not going first, Noe-chi?

00:15:39.920 --> 00:15:44.210
But you're hurt. So we can't compete.

00:15:44.510 --> 00:15:52.180
That's okay. Its not like I can't move or anything just because of my injury...but if you don't move

00:15:52.350 --> 00:15:55.390
I will get angry.

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:05.190
I already said before, but that's why I hate you!

00:16:05.190 --> 00:16:07.240
But I like you.

00:16:14.870 --> 00:16:17.830
If I win, I won't give you that water!

00:16:18.370 --> 00:16:19.630
What now?

00:16:19.830 --> 00:16:22.250
Senpai, you should go first.

00:16:22.250 --> 00:16:24.340
Huh? I'm not gonna leave you behind.

00:16:24.340 --> 00:16:24.960
Im gonna get angry.

00:16:24.840 --> 00:16:27.930
I won't leave you.

00:16:28.550 --> 00:16:30.970
We have no choice. You guys help me.

00:16:30.970 --> 00:16:32.350
Our kouhai is in trouble.

00:16:33.220 --> 00:16:36.020
That's right, where is that woman?

00:16:37.020 --> 00:16:39.270
She already left.

00:16:39.270 --> 00:16:41.060
What!?

00:16:43.070 --> 00:16:47.490
Why is the old man from that fire incident here too?

00:16:47.490 --> 00:16:50.740
It's gonna be troublesome. I should run and get out of here.

00:16:52.160 --> 00:16:58.210
In other words...our strongest opponent has bailed out!

00:16:58.500 --> 00:17:02.380
We're gonna settle our score with that woman one day.

00:17:02.380 --> 00:17:04.540
Her daughter is weak too, right?

00:17:04.540 --> 00:17:06.550
Huh? You guys know her?

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:09.010
It could be that I saw her at the parent-teacher meeting.

00:17:11.130 --> 00:17:14.550
Forget it. Let's go!

00:17:21.400 --> 00:17:24.360
Sheesh...why do I have to do this?

00:17:27.110 --> 00:17:30.860
I look like an idiot!

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:36.580
Sorry for the wait...and goodbye!

00:17:37.040 --> 00:17:39.120
What the hell!

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:41.290
Huh, we can't say goodbye.

00:17:41.290 --> 00:17:48.590
Kukuku...I'll tell you something. This is the combination of our Game Club members' powers...

00:17:49.050 --> 00:17:52.180
All club member super cavalry.

00:17:52.180 --> 00:17:54.680
You've clearly forgetten about him, haven't you?!

00:17:54.680 --> 00:17:59.600
But that cavalry won't beat me who can run by myself!

00:17:59.850 --> 00:18:02.310
If that's the case, we have to use our Plan B.

00:18:02.310 --> 00:18:03.730
Did you hear me Kazama-san?

00:18:03.730 --> 00:18:07.110
Gonna do the usual, huh? I'm counting on it.

00:18:07.400 --> 00:18:10.440
Is it really going to be that different?

00:18:10.440 --> 00:18:14.700
Don't be afraid of our strength...power push!

00:18:14.700 --> 00:18:18.990
Until now we just paced our speed with Kazama-san.

00:18:19.040 --> 00:18:21.290
Oh! That's right! I'm slow, sorry!

00:18:21.290 --> 00:18:22.870
Here it comes!

00:18:22.870 --> 00:18:23.540
Come!

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:25.420
Ready...

00:18:26.920 --> 00:18:29.420
Ohh, the power push is so fast!

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:31.510
What's with that speed?!

00:18:31.510 --> 00:18:33.050
Fast, isn't it?

00:18:33.050 --> 00:18:34.890
You're doing nothing!

00:18:34.890 --> 00:18:41.730
My job is to hug Kazama senpai and do a mental attack on Noe-chi.

00:18:41.730 --> 00:18:44.730
I won't do that again.

00:18:44.730 --> 00:18:49.520
Idiot! My Aniki's hair is amazing you know. Idiot, idiot!

00:18:50.530 --> 00:18:52.070
Are you alright?!

00:18:54.650 --> 00:18:56.660
She's got spirit.

00:18:56.820 --> 00:19:01.830
That's my imouto rival! She's a worthy opponent to beat.

00:19:01.950 --> 00:19:06.580
Shut up! This is it. I won't let you win!

00:19:06.630 --> 00:19:12.090
I won't let you! I can't lose to my own sister. I must win!

00:19:12.960 --> 00:19:17.340
Huh? Since when has this become a sibling competition?

00:19:21.600 --> 00:19:26.560
Must win!

00:19:28.690 --> 00:19:31.150
Sorry...our bad...

00:19:31.150 --> 00:19:35.030
Your bad huh...

00:19:38.700 --> 00:19:42.080
Too bad, but it was fun.

00:19:44.080 --> 00:19:46.210
Next year, let's work hard too okay?

00:19:46.210 --> 00:19:51.000
No. Next year I won't enter...stop you're too bright.

00:19:51.590 --> 00:19:53.300
What's wrong?

00:19:53.300 --> 00:19:57.300
Sorry to inform you, but you won't be able to drink this legendary water.

00:19:57.470 --> 00:20:02.260
What is this?! Sensei, when did you...?

00:20:02.390 --> 00:20:05.140
Sorry, everyone.

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:05.730
What?

00:20:05.730 --> 00:20:10.230
This spring water is a fake.

00:20:10.230 --> 00:20:14.280
That's right. It's just tap water.

00:20:14.280 --> 00:20:15.740
Seriously!

00:20:16.030 --> 00:20:18.610
So all this time it was for nothing...

00:20:19.160 --> 00:20:25.580
You're that shocked?! Are you alright? Hey!

00:20:34.880 --> 00:20:37.130
Yo, you're still sulking?

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:42.680
My waterways...still have a long way to go...

00:20:42.930 --> 00:20:48.810
by what I mean is my waterways of water...

00:20:48.850 --> 00:20:50.020
Forget about that!

00:20:50.020 --> 00:20:52.060
I'll give back your Onii-chan, okay?

00:20:52.060 --> 00:20:55.780
I never recalled giving him to you. He's my aniki. Also, what do you mean by the way?

00:20:55.780 --> 00:20:58.280
You two sure are close.

00:20:58.280 --> 00:20:59.400
Huh, what?

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:01.450
Both of you are airheads.

00:21:11.250 --> 00:21:20.880
You know...that fake water tastes good too.

00:21:23.390 --> 00:21:24.890
What is it?

00:21:24.890 --> 00:21:27.680
You two sure are siblings...

00:21:27.680 --> 00:21:32.060
Wh...what are you saying? By the way you promised to buy me an ice cream.

00:21:32.060 --> 00:21:34.400
Did I make that promise?

00:21:34.560 --> 00:21:39.530
What? You've forgotten already? You really are a selfish person.

00:21:39.530 --> 00:21:44.740
That's not it. Of course I remember my promise to you.

00:21:45.080 --> 00:21:48.660
Hey, that nickname that you called me...

00:21:48.660 --> 00:21:50.000
What is it?

00:21:50.580 --> 00:21:55.340
Nothing. Let's go, Sakura.

00:22:01.420 --> 00:22:03.510
Ice cream, huh?

00:22:05.180 --> 00:22:09.180
After eating ice cream, we should drink water to flush out the sweet sensation.

00:22:09.180 --> 00:22:11.520
It's true, isn't it? It turns out that ice cream and water are bound to each other, right?

00:22:11.850 --> 00:22:15.560
Nah, I still prefer to drink milk after eating ice cream.

00:22:15.560 --> 00:22:20.030
What are you girls still doing there?

00:22:20.030 --> 00:22:22.070
Ice cream after that milk.

00:22:22.070 --> 00:22:23.740
That's no good.

00:22:24.070 --> 00:22:26.070
Ice cream and milk...

00:24:00.340 --> 00:24:05.300
Delicious. Mom's rice today is delicious right...

00:24:05.300 --> 00:24:08.130
Rice? No, it must be the water.

00:24:08.390 --> 00:24:10.850
So any water was fine...
